        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">
        * BGE-M3 p95 measured on single NVIDIA L4 GPU instance running vLLM embedding server. Proprietary models measured via direct HTTPS API from us-east-1.
